{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/139219-limits-of-alibi","id":139219,"title":"Limits of Alibi","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-05-16T05:56:26-07:00","id":139219,"title":"Limits of Alibi","content":"The Alibi Embed says that the projected Cover cannot take &quot;meaningful action&quot; - summed up as anything requiring a dice roll - but there are more ways to be meaningful than that. Would you allow it as messaging system, or would the delivery of important news to a distant party count as meaningful? What about having the projected Cover be <i>near</i> you - the intended alibi being that if Cover X and Cover Y are seen at the same time, you'll have a much better chance of convincing a third party that they're not the same demon - would you allow that, or is that level of deception too meaningful?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/321-sunlessnick","name":"SunlessNick","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1214"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-16T10:33:14-07:00","id":139520,"title":"","content":"You would be doing the deception. The cover would just happen to be there. But if someone suspects that much I doubt such a thin piece of evidence would help.<br /> <br /> I feel the best use of alibi is maintaining cover when you don't have the time. Sure it can't do any meaningful tasks but an average day at the office, visiting the in laws or even just milling around is enough to prevent it from degrading. My personal feeling on limits, if it muscle memory or something you could do without a real exertion of effort yes. Tuning a watch like you have a thousand time? Fine, but if something goes wrong it will lack the ability to fix it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2909-mr-f-i-x","name":"Mr.F.I.X.","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2909_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1053"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-18T07:31:00-07:00","id":141565,"title":"","content":"Also, I would definitely count sending messages as meaningful. Since Embeds get into the laws of universe, I think the universe can feel pretty well the intend behind it. And this embed specifically allows you to create an alibi for the cover. If you try to go further than that, I'd ask for a different Embed (or perhaps even an Exploit, based on Alibi)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B5_EJSgV1u4SOFFJc3M5VmFDWVk?resourcekey=0-GEErNnDbGqlKYgoiuGausw&amp;usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Bloodline conversions</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1IbeKfqhWuG8jPN9vpGmDo0VY9n9-4ejxvRzfJRoir4k/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My House rules</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/294-griautis","name":"Griautis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar294_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-18T09:36:23-07:00","id":141641,"title":"","content":"I can't believe I'm about to reference a Happy Madison movie...But in the movie Click, they have this thing where, when Adam Sandler fast-forwards through time, his body goes on a sort of auto-pilot, doing what the remote has recorded as normal behavior for him. It's not as hi-jinksie as you'd think, It's just doing what you do to get on to the next point.(Sandler doesn't do egregiously stupid things for humor sake's, although he does do things for expediency of his goal's sake)<br /> <br /> Alibi kind of works like that. When you use it, the Cover takes over and does what would be normal for it to do. It's not really a thing you control, you're letting the program go on auto-pilot, doing the most normal and mundane things you do in your life. It goes through your routine and tries not to deal with more strenuous affairs.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}